cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "YOLO Annotation Reviewer"
abstract: >
  Keyboard-driven OpenCV tool for reviewing and editing YOLO bounding-box
  annotations. Features include zoom/pan, corner and edge handles for bbox
  resizing, copy-paste across frames, frame rejection, progress persistence,
  and direct frame navigation.
authors:
